From 8680dfbeab768c6843a7889b5cdf8f7a1885526a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Majid Arasskhani <M.Arasskhani@gosilkroad.net>
Date: Mon, 14 Sep 2026 10:53:28 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 6/7] chore(backend): remove unused imports/variables; add
 ruff.toml defect-class gate

ruff --select E9,F63,F7,F82,F401,F841,B006,E722: 92 unused imports and 23
unused locals removed across 65 files. The 12 'access = await
require_capability(...)' guards keep the call and drop the binding; dead
value expressions (content_preview, merged, key_to_label, referer, user_key,
settings) are deleted outright. No behaviour change: full suite 1260 passed /
3 skipped on Python 3.12 before and after.

backend/ruff.toml pins the same rule set so CI can enforce it (Phase 0);
style and complexity rules are deferred to the Phase 3 formatting pass.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01UTnpHajSmkk2JMLfuQoV7o
